cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Tomobit or build on its design, please cite it as below."
title: "Tomobit: a Living Harness that learns which AI to trust, in which context"
abstract: >-
  Tomobit stands in front of multiple coding AIs (Claude Code, Codex, local
  models) and learns, from lived experience, which provider and which plan
  works in which context. Knowledge is a living Connection Graph backed by a
  single decayed Beta ledger; meaning is assigned by a local LLM, but every
  judgment is a pure function (pessimistic capability gate plus Thompson
  sampling). Connections discover their own context granularity by splitting
  and merging under a corrected log Bayes factor driven by excess surprisal.
  The ledger lives in one SQLite file owned by the user.
type: software
authors:
